        <activityName xml:lang="en">Flux, wave soldering, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Flux, wave soldering, at plant
This is a rough dataset for a flux used in the wave solder process of the electronics industry. The dataset contains only information about the ingredients.;
UUID: 5e0796ab-7af3-3319-a2ca-0084830f14d0
This dataset includes only the raw materials (i.e. the main ingredients) of an example of a wave solder flux. No information about mixing efforts, waste and emissions produced, used infrastructure and transport are included.
Location: This module relates to the global situation. 
Technology: Dataset represents one example of a mixture used as wave solder flux in the electronics industry
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature &amp; own estimations 
Extrapolations: see Geography and Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_5e0796ab-7af3-3319-a2ca-0084830f14d0.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
